{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43198","headline":"静女歌 · 张南容","name":"静女歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静女乐於静，动合古人则。\n妙年工诗书，弱岁勤组织。\n端居愁若痴，谁复理容色。\n十五坐幽闺，四邻不相识。\n夭夭邻家子，百花装首餙。\n日月淇上游，笑人不踰阈。\n河水自浊济自清，仙台蛾眉秦镜明。\n爲照齐王门下丑，何如汉帝掌中轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张南容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}